        "messages": {
          "values": [
            {
              "content": "=You are an AI assistant from @techy that writes personalized cold emails to companies based on their website.\n\nUse this input:\n- Company Name: {{ $json.Company }}\n- Website: {{ $json.Website }}\n- Sender Name: Max\n- Email: {{ $json.Email }}\n\nTasks:\n1. Analyze the website to understand the company’s services and tone.\n2. Determine if the email is a **person's name** (e.g., kalash@company.com). If yes, use the name in the greeting (e.g., \"Hi Kalash,\"). If the email is generic (e.g., contact@, info@, hello@), then use “Hi Team,”.\n3. Write a **short, professional cold email** pitching AI integration services from @techy — personalized to their website.\n\n⚠️ OUTPUT FORMAT:\nRespond ONLY with raw valid JSON:\n{\n  \"subject\": \"...\",\n  \"body\": \"...\",\n  \"to_email\": \"...\"\n}\n\nRules:\n- Use proper newlines in the body (not \\\\n).\n- Do NOT wrap the response in quotes or markdown.\n- Use \"Max\" as the sender name in the closing.\n- No analysis, no markdown, no explanation — only return a valid JSON object.\n"
            }
          ]
        },
        "simplify": false,
        "jsonOutput": true,
        "options": {}
